{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"お披露目されてから\n丸4年が経ちました！\nはやかったなあ。\n5年目もよろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで\nこんばんは！伊藤純奈です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2017/05/17/2935356/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スイカのみんなが沖縄に\n旅行に行ってたんだけど、\n直前に仕事が入っちゃって\n急遽行けなくなっちゃったの(o_o)\nでもみんな楽しめたみたいで\nよかった〜〜！次は一緒に行きたい〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなりましたm(__)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋全握、個握\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握はあみちゃんとペア\nだいすきあみちゃん〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2017/05/17/2935356/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台のお話が多かったかな？\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次の日は個握"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2017/05/17/2935356/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トップス FURFURのもの\nなんだけど形が可愛くて\nお気に入り！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてこの前は\n横浜で個握(*´꒳`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2017/05/17/2935356/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全身撮るの忘れちゃった〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの方が並んで\nくださって嬉しかったです♪\nいつもありがとう〜\n初めましての方も来てくれて\nありがとうございます♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2017/05/17/2935356/0004.j